/ActualText (React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase\n\nBuilt a full-stack, Google Keep-inspired notes application with complete CRUD functionality, allowing users to create, edit, color-tag, and organize notes in a responsive masonry-style layout. Implemented real-time updates, persistent storage, and a clean, animated UI using Framer Motion for smooth note transitions and interactions.)
